    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tainted Pools is a first-person liminal space survival horror game inspired by Backrooms lore. Explore the eerie poolrooms and corridors of Backrooms Level 130, where a stalking entity lurks in the shadows, drawn to every sound you make. Scavenge for resources and survive long enough to find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lurking threat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster moves unseen through the pipes, waiting for a chance to strike. It hears your footsteps, sees your light, and reacts instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/eca20d44ca13e3fd4b2a41e62a1e523b.poster.avif?t=1752483224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/eca20d44ca13e3fd4b2a41e62a1e523b.webm?t=1752483224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/eca20d44ca13e3fd4b2a41e62a1e523b.mp4?t=1752483224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay hidden</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoiding detection is always your best option. Fight only if there\u2019s no other choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/6320d80121d19a6e9cfc8f3b6d793515.poster.avif?t=1752483224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/6320d80121d19a6e9cfc8f3b6d793515.webm?t=1752483224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/6320d80121d19a6e9cfc8f3b6d793515.mp4?t=1752483224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge for items that help you survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With limited inventory space, you\u2019ll need to prioritize the essentials and choose the right tools to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/df520d3147af58bc2d75a23ddf387967.poster.avif?t=1752483224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/df520d3147af58bc2d75a23ddf387967.webm?t=1752483224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/df520d3147af58bc2d75a23ddf387967.mp4?t=1752483224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized item spawn</strong> \u2013 Resources and items change locations with each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hostile entity</strong> \u2013 A terrifying entity hunts you, reacting to your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited saves</strong> \u2013 Saving is only available at the hub room, adding risk to your exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi-open world</strong> \u2013 Explore interconnected poolrooms and corridors, choosing your own path.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tainted Pools is a first-person liminal space survival horror game inspired by Backrooms lore. Explore the eerie poolrooms and corridors of Backrooms Level 130, where a stalking entity lurks in the shadows, drawn to every sound you make. Scavenge for resources and survive long enough to find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lurking threat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster moves unseen through the pipes, waiting for a chance to strike. It hears your footsteps, sees your light, and reacts instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/eca20d44ca13e3fd4b2a41e62a1e523b.poster.avif?t=1752483224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/eca20d44ca13e3fd4b2a41e62a1e523b.webm?t=1752483224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/eca20d44ca13e3fd4b2a41e62a1e523b.mp4?t=1752483224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay hidden</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoiding detection is always your best option. Fight only if there\u2019s no other choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/6320d80121d19a6e9cfc8f3b6d793515.poster.avif?t=1752483224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/6320d80121d19a6e9cfc8f3b6d793515.webm?t=1752483224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/6320d80121d19a6e9cfc8f3b6d793515.mp4?t=1752483224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge for items that help you survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With limited inventory space, you\u2019ll need to prioritize the essentials and choose the right tools to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/df520d3147af58bc2d75a23ddf387967.poster.avif?t=1752483224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/df520d3147af58bc2d75a23ddf387967.webm?t=1752483224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/df520d3147af58bc2d75a23ddf387967.mp4?t=1752483224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized item spawn</strong> \u2013 Resources and items change locations with each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hostile entity</strong> \u2013 A terrifying entity hunts you, reacting to your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited saves</strong> \u2013 Saving is only available at the hub room, adding risk to your exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi-open world</strong> \u2013 Explore interconnected poolrooms and corridors, choosing your own path.</p></li></ul>",
